Runtime dependencies (NOT bundled, expected from the host OS):
  - ffmpeg (used via exec for probing, thumbnails and demo-wallpaper
    synthesis; on TerraMaster TOS the factory-provided /usr/bin/ffmpeg
    is used). No upstream/CDN media assets are shipped or downloaded
    by this software: all wallpapers come from user uploads or are
    synthesized locally by ffmpeg.
